{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fragments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fragments</i> is a <strong>first-person psychological horror</strong> game with a focus on<strong> puzzles and narrative</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve mind-bending puzzles</strong> as you uncover fragments of your shattered memory. But beware, you\u2019re not alone. Your inner tormentor is always one step behind, trying to keep you from the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003440/extras/b07c6384764e09f7bcd80f2fe06eacd6.poster.avif?t=1757645145\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003440/extras/b07c6384764e09f7bcd80f2fe06eacd6.webm?t=1757645145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003440/extras/b07c6384764e09f7bcd80f2fe06eacd6.mp4?t=1757645145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fragments of the Past</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>3 memory fragments</strong>, tied to one of your<strong> traumatic periods</strong> in your life. Every fragment reveals a piece of your forgotten past and brings you closer to confronting what you\u2019ve buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003440/extras/2f6e867f0d67f182da95c5ceb633236c.poster.avif?t=1757645145\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003440/extras/2f6e867f0d67f182da95c5ceb633236c.webm?t=1757645145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003440/extras/2f6e867f0d67f182da95c5ceb633236c.mp4?t=1757645145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each memory fragment comes with its <strong>own type of puzzle</strong>, tailored to the trauma it represents. No two are the same. Think carefully, and move fast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Maze-like Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 1st level in the game, a twisted, maze-like suffocating forest that reflects your inner turmoil, closely tied to your traumatic part of your life. Containing a total of 3 memory fragments in it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face Your Tormentor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your <strong>inner tormentor</strong> is relentless. It will do everything it can to stop you from recovering your memories. Escape it and confront the veil that shrouds your memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003440/extras/bb5f82054fa503a3571170b20ba962fd.poster.avif?t=1757645145\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003440/extras/bb5f82054fa503a3571170b20ba962fd.webm?t=1757645145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003440/extras/bb5f82054fa503a3571170b20ba962fd.mp4?t=1757645145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Does the Game Offer?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<strong>Multiple paths</strong> to complete your playthrough</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<strong>High replayability</strong> \u2013 complete <strong>3 unique runs</strong> to collect all 3 fragments for the first level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<strong>40-50 minutes of total playtime</strong> depending on your skill</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<strong>Challenging, original puzzles</strong> tied to memory and trauma</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f <strong>Can you survive your own mind and face the truth you tried to forget?</strong> \ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4003440?t=1757645145","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003440/deeff8b91ebf6a856dc189b6f1e76c2092f02522/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757645145","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003440/6d2c3801dd69ace252142632b058d83a06be4018/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757645145","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003440/6d2c3801dd69ace252142632b058d83a06be4018/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757645145","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains depictions of attempted suicide, violence, death and alcohol abuse."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fragments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fragments</i> is a <strong>first-person psychological horror</strong> game with a focus on<strong> puzzles and narrative</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve mind-bending puzzles</strong> as you uncover fragments of your shattered memory. But beware, you\u2019re not alone. Your inner tormentor is always one step behind, trying to keep you from the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003440/extras/b07c6384764e09f7bcd80f2fe06eacd6.poster.avif?t=1757645145\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003440/extras/b07c6384764e09f7bcd80f2fe06eacd6.webm?t=1757645145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003440/extras/b07c6384764e09f7bcd80f2fe06eacd6.mp4?t=1757645145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fragments of the Past</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>3 memory fragments</strong>, tied to one of your<strong> traumatic periods</strong> in your life. Every fragment reveals a piece of your forgotten past and brings you closer to confronting what you\u2019ve buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003440/extras/2f6e867f0d67f182da95c5ceb633236c.poster.avif?t=1757645145\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003440/extras/2f6e867f0d67f182da95c5ceb633236c.webm?t=1757645145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003440/extras/2f6e867f0d67f182da95c5ceb633236c.mp4?t=1757645145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each memory fragment comes with its <strong>own type of puzzle</strong>, tailored to the trauma it represents. No two are the same. Think carefully, and move fast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Maze-like Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 1st level in the game, a twisted, maze-like suffocating forest that reflects your inner turmoil, closely tied to your traumatic part of your life. Containing a total of 3 memory fragments in it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face Your Tormentor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your <strong>inner tormentor</strong> is relentless. It will do everything it can to stop you from recovering your memories. Escape it and confront the veil that shrouds your memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003440/extras/bb5f82054fa503a3571170b20ba962fd.poster.avif?t=1757645145\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003440/extras/bb5f82054fa503a3571170b20ba962fd.webm?t=1757645145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003440/extras/bb5f82054fa503a3571170b20ba962fd.mp4?t=1757645145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Does the Game Offer?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<strong>Multiple paths</strong> to complete your playthrough</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<strong>High replayability</strong> \u2013 complete <strong>3 unique runs</strong> to collect all 3 fragments for the first level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<strong>40-50 minutes of total playtime</strong> depending on your skill</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<strong>Challenging, original puzzles</strong> tied to memory and trauma</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f <strong>Can you survive your own mind and face the truth you tried to forget?</strong> \ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f</p>","developers":["Lazar Varagic","Alex X","Vidan Tomic"],"fullgame":{"appid":"4003260","name":"Fragments"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003440/14b299be81a4fd0f32391ab39c25d130f3692532/header.jpg?t=1757645145","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257191895,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191895/movie480.mp4?t=1757645144","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191895/movie_max.mp4?t=1757645144"},"name":"Fragments - Announce Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257191895/7547140c2fce0c3a5423ba69ea76682d252d8498/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757645144","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191895/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757645144","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191895/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1757645144"}}],"name":"Fragments Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_r